<title>NETHERLANDS: ING Barings ups Anglo-Dutch CMG to a Buy.</title>
<headline>ING Barings ups Anglo-Dutch CMG to a Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of March 12 research.</p>
<p>Company--------- Sector------------Price----Broker---------</p>
<p>    CMG     Computer services 38.30    ING Barings</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy (from Hold). EPS in Dutch guilders raised based on average pound/guilder rate of 2.85 guilders for 1997 and 2.73 for 1998. Growth of sales in Netherlands and UK very healthy, operating margins there also remain healthy. Germany to swing back into profit. Twelve-month price target of 42.00 guilders.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS     pvs EPS   P/E    P/CF   Dividend</p>
<p>    1997		  1.09    0.91</p>
<p>    1998		  1.24    1.05</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
